<title>USA: TABLE-Grey Advertising Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Grey Advertising Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $5.37		    $4.88</p>
<p> Net			    7.7			6.8</p>
<p> Gross billings	   1,375		    1,244</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     1.4			1.4</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $8.91		    $9.39</p>
<p> Net			   12.3		     13.1</p>
<p> Gross billings	   2,634		    2,401</p>
<p> Avg			    1.4			1.4</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Grey Advertising Inc's outstanding share and earnings per share figures are fully-diluted.</p>
<p>The company's six-month net earnings for 1996 include a non-operating $4 million gain. Excluding the gain, net earnings would have been $11.0 million and earnings per fully-diluted share would be $7.91 for the six months in 1996.</p>
<p>Gross billings computed in accordance with industry practice of multiplying income from commissions and fees by 6.67.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
